sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant RL as Limiter Client
    participant R as Redis
    participant BE as Backend

    C->>GW: HTTP request
    GW->>RL: checkLimit(key)
    RL->>R: EVAL lua_script
    R--xRL: timeout / connection refused
    RL->>RL: circuit breaker OPEN<br/>policy = fail-open
    RL-->>GW: {allowed: true, degraded: true}
    Note over GW: Alert fired: redis_unavailable
    GW->>BE: forward request (no block)
    BE-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>C: 200 OK
